WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.209
Enough of this!

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:05.046
You never stood a chance.

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.381
A Bronze Knight like you

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:09.718
was never going to overcome
a Gold Knight like me.

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:11.845
[groaning]

00:00:11.928 --> 00:00:15.056
They were afraid
I would betray Sanctuary, too,

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.559
but I won't, ever!

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:19.561
Lightning Bolt!

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:26.568
[gasps]

00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:32.323
No. It can't be.

00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:44.169
Impossible!

00:00:44.252 --> 00:00:47.422
Why would the Sagittarius Armor
protect you?

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:49.424
The Armor has a mind of its own.

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:50.925
[growls]

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:52.927
Brother, why?

00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:55.764
You're about to find out
just how powerful I am!

00:00:55.847 --> 00:00:56.723
[yells]

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:00.351
[sighs]

00:01:02.187 --> 00:01:04.481
You took my sister,
just to kill her?

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:06.858
This isn't about your sister.

00:01:06.941 --> 00:01:09.319
No one gives a damn about her.

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:12.405
This is about
the very survival of humanity!

00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:17.744
[chuckles]

00:01:17.827 --> 00:01:19.079
[grunts]

00:01:19.162 --> 00:01:24.084
If mankind is to survive,
then Sienna must die!

00:01:24.167 --> 00:01:26.878
Using the Gold Armor
to protect her is madness!

00:01:26.961 --> 00:01:27.879
[gasps]

00:01:27.962 --> 00:01:29.589
You're not serious, are you?

00:01:29.672 --> 00:01:30.590
Huh?

00:01:30.673 --> 00:01:31.883
You're a piece of garbage

00:01:31.966 --> 00:01:34.385
if you believe in the prophecy
more than your brother!

00:01:34.469 --> 00:01:36.763
What do you know
about my brother?

00:01:36.846 --> 00:01:39.474
His failure has been a burden
that I've had to carry.

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:40.767
You're wrong!

00:01:40.809 --> 00:01:43.353
Your brother
gave humanity one last chance.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:46.356
Athena will fight for mankind,
no matter what,

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:48.358
and we support her to the death.

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:50.360
If you lose
your faith in Athena,

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:52.362
then what's the point
of being a Knight?

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:53.279
Silence!

00:01:53.363 --> 00:01:56.241
It's our job to stop
the prophecy from happening,

00:01:56.324 --> 00:01:58.868
to keep the peace,
to save humanity!

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:00.286
Enough!

00:02:01.996 --> 00:02:04.874
Pegasus Ryu-Sei-Ken!

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:11.464
Lightning Bolt!

00:02:11.548 --> 00:02:12.841
[yells]

00:02:12.924 --> 00:02:15.885
You may wear
the Armor of a Gold Knight,

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:18.138
but we both know
you're unworthy.

00:02:19.848 --> 00:02:21.933
You're the unworthy one.

00:02:22.016 --> 00:02:23.810
You killed my sister.

00:02:24.185 --> 00:02:25.979
Now you want to murder Athena.

00:02:26.062 --> 00:02:29.649
I have to! It's the only way
to save mankind.

00:02:29.732 --> 00:02:31.734
I'll protect Sienna.

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:34.028
I may not be as smart as you

00:02:34.112 --> 00:02:37.031
or know exactly everything
that's happening around us...

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:42.829
but I know she's a human being,
and I'm going to protect her.

00:02:45.373 --> 00:02:45.582
For a moment,
you sounded like my brother,

